hub.com/repos/xunit/xunit/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/deployments","created_at":"2013-05-06T16:37:13Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T22:21:40Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T03:06:04Z","git_url":"git://github.com/xunit/xunit.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:xunit/xunit.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit","homepage":"https://xunit.net/","size":18675,"stargazers_count":4495,"watchers_count":4495,"language":"C#","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":823,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":58,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["c-sharp","dotnet","unit-testing","xunit"],"visibility":"public","forks":823,"open_issues":58,"watchers":4495,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Hello,\n\nI have parametrized `[Theory]` tests which contain `ClassData` attributes, for example `[ClassData(typeof(InvalidPasswordTheoryData))]`\n\nI developed a set of tests and I decided to bump the `xUnit v3` version. I was surprised to see that my total of 47 tests which were discovered in the test runner were immediately reduced to 18 tests. I went into the `xunit.v3 3.0.0 changelog` and noted this breaking change https://github.com/xunit/xunit/issues/3319. While this change appears to address attributes that throw in their constructors (which my code does not have), my assumption is that what I'm experiencing might be some type of regression which occurred around this bugfix.\n\nI updated my `ClassData` attributes to be generic, for example `[ClassData<InvalidPasswordTheoryData>]` but the issue persisted.\n\nAny ideas on how to solve this, am I missing something or this is indeed a bug? For the time being I downgraded from `xunit.v3 3.0.0` back to `2.0.3`, and as soon as I do this, the test runner immediately discovers all of my 47 tests.\n\nHere is an example structure of the `TheoryData` class:\n\n\n```\npublic sealed class InvalidPasswordTheoryData : TheoryData<RegisterUserDto>\n{\n    public InvalidPasswordTheoryData()\n    {\n        var faker = new Faker();\n\n        var baseRequest = new RegisterUserDto\n        {\n            Email = faker.Internet.Email(),\n            Password = faker.Internet.Password(12)\n        };\n\n        var tooShortRequest = baseRequest.DeepClone();\n        tooShortRequest.Password = faker.Internet.Password(5);\n        Add(tooShortRequest);\n    }\n}\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3357/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3357/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]